<title>USA: McDonalds Corp to serve up some debt.</title>
<headline>McDonalds Corp to serve up some debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. fast-food giant McDonalds Corp is expected to serve up a $150 million debt offering via Salomon Brothers Inc, dealers said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Aa2/AA rated deal is expected to consist of a 10-year noncallable maturity, dealers said.</p>
<p>Unofficial price talk on the issue is seen at 37.5 basis points over U.S. Treasuries.</p>
<p>(( -- Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675 ))</p>
